## Why This Is Asked
Tests end-to-end AWS AI workflow design, cross-service orchestration, and production-readiness for moderation at scale. Emphasizes privacy, encryption, and cost considerations.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven architecture across regions
- Rekognition, Comprehend, and SageMaker integration
- DynamoDB as index and state store; SQS for human-in-the-loop
- Privacy controls: encryption, access controls, data residency
- Reliability: idempotency, retries, error handling

